          "topic": "Scope",
          "instructions": "A synthetic shipment with fixed lots, workers, preparation choices and carrier services. Times are synthetic days. Adapt the model for different operating catalogs."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Starting values",
          "instructions": "Prefilled values are fictional examples. Changing part of the workbook can leave example inputs in the case."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Editing",
          "instructions": "Edit the named input sheets. Keep worksheet names, column headers and record identifiers. Do not add formulas. Other case inputs remain unchanged."
        },
        {
          "topic": "Units and time",
          "instructions": "Times are synthetic days and expenses are hypothetical USD. Do not interpret day numbers as dates or clocks."
        },
